OL,3,APastor died when festival arch fell,
OL,4,Ainquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pastor died from "multiple severe
OL,7,Finjuries" when a large wooden arch fell
OL,8,Fon him at a Christian event in West
OL,9,FSussex, an inquest opening heard.
OL,11,FRobert Guanco, 41, was a pastor at
OL,12,FJesus the Living Water Church in
OL,13,FEastbourne, East Sussex, and attended
OL,14,Fthe Big Church Festival, near Steyning,
OL,15,Fon 28 August.
OL,17,FAn inquest opening at Woodvale
OL,18,FCoroner's Court in Brighton on
OL,19,FWednesday heard that Guanco suffered
OL,20,Fmultiple severe injuries and blunt
OL,21,Fforce trauma.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
