OL,3,APastor died when festival arch fell,
OL,4,Ainquest told
OL,5,
OL,6,FSpeaking afterwards, his widow Isaeli
OL,7,Fsaid she hoped learning the truth about
OL,8,Fwhat happened to her husband would
OL,9,F"help us grieve" and "prevent other
OL,10,Ffamilies going through the same thing".
